OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy with the odd spot
OL,6,Fof rain and some hill fog across the
OL,7,FDerbyshire hills. The odd brighter
OL,8,Fspell through the middle of the day
OL,9,Fbefore rain moves into the south
OL,10,Flater. Light winds and near average
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight. Light rain in
OL,15,Fthe south initially, moving northwards
OL,16,Fduring the evening then turning misty
OL,17,Fby dawn. Light winds. Cool, especially
OL,18,Fin rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
