OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy and damp start with
OL,6,Fmist and patchy light rain,
OL,7,Fparticularly in the east. Turning
OL,8,Fdrier with the odd brighter spell in
OL,9,Fthe west. Feeling cool with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure remains dominant. Cloudy with
OL,14,Fpatchy light rain on Sunday, but
OL,15,Fbecoming drier and brighter for Monday
OL,16,Fand Tuesday. Light winds and
OL,17,Ftemperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
